# Cline & Windsurf Rules for Agno Multi-Agent Template

- Follow clean architecture boundaries in `backend/app/` and `frontend/src/`.
- Use Agno 2.x imports: `agno.agent.Agent`, `agno.team.Team`, `agno.db.postgres.PostgresDb`, `agno.db.sqlite.SqliteDb`.
- Never bypass tests; verify edits with `cd backend && PYTHONPATH=. pytest tests/ -v`.
